cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the EBImage package when reporting analyses produced with this workflow."
title: "IHC and Immunofluorescence Quantification Skill"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "IHC and IF Quantification Skill contributors"
version: 2.3.0-rc2
date-released: 2026-08-25
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible and auditable R/EBImage workflow for brightfield DAB-IHC and
  multi-channel immunofluorescence quantification, with reviewed ROI support,
  four explicit IF measurement domains, colocalization, puncta analysis,
  quality control, and biological-unit-level comparison figures.
keywords:
  - immunohistochemistry
  - DAB
  - image analysis
  - EBImage
  - H-score
  - reproducible research
  - immunofluorescence
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - bioimage analysis
  - colocalization
  - cell segmentation
  - puncta quantification
